A tier without `_schemas/mechanic.yaml` has no `mechanic` type, even with a `mechanic/`
directory: `next` rejects it, naming the tier's types.

-- fixtures/cwd/.booping --
project_name: probe
vault_path: ./vault
latest_migration: 9999
-- fixtures/cwd/vault/mechanic/0001-dash.md --
---
type: mechanic
title: Dash
summary: A short burst of speed on a cooldown.
status: accepted
---

## Loop

Press, burst, wait for the cooldown.
-- cmd --
booping specs next mechanic
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: unknown type `mechanic`; known: adr, conflict, idea, reference, rule, runbook, story, value
